{"reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "review": {"abstract": "其间我们可能会看到一些新兴经济体的复兴，比如20世纪80年代至90年代的亚洲四小龙，", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "现在的共识就是，亚洲四小龙的崛起是因为产业转移。但是一旦切换成康波视角，总是给我一种虚妄感，康波这种看周期的视角真的非常不着地", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "5453-5495", "createTime": 1774331335, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "userVid": 3215729, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 11879018, "name": "仲钟", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/hKWCeDBRx5Z05ZhyIremyTMF9Rjl8icYQhnbEIJiafJVibMiaLia5njsE4e48FApMVUzKysBhcCAK8DiaGVrKJLjic4Qg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你可能没看全，周金涛核心逻辑是把全球经济体分为消费主导国，制造国和资源国。所以你说的产业转移最终也在这个框架里。", "reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "commentId": "3215729_87Q65j64o_c426066534_88i6wfMYP", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1775922139, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "亚洲四小龙的崛起并非直接由科技革命引领，而是通过承接科技革命带来的产业转移与技术扩散实现跨越式发展。只能说新兴经济体的复兴是一个落后指标，此时科技革命带来的消费场景已经出现，新兴经济体只是把这种需求落地罢了。", "reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "commentId": "3215729_87Q65j64o_c3215729_87Thv19bx", "userVid": 3215729, "createTime": 1774512193, "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"content": "衰退期到复苏期要跨超过 10 年，前面说的衰退信号是全世界范围的金融危机，这种程度的金融危机只能说主要经济体美国引发，才具有这种能量，但是复苏信号突然提到新兴经济体的崛起，这些新兴经济体的崛起显然无法成为全球经济的主角，这种转换是为何？\n\n一般来说复苏肯定伴随新的科技革命的推动，这绝不可能发生在新兴经济体，只可能发生在先发优势的资本主义大国（当然也包括社会主义国家的中国）。那么把新兴经济体的崛起作为复苏信号来加以描述感觉怪怪的，只说说世界主要经济体增长已经乏力了，新兴经济体只是凭借后发优势好看些罢了，体量上不可同日而语。\n\n那么复苏的信号到底是什么呢？根据前文作者观点，有一个判断应该不会错，但是已经比较晚了，那就是新的科技革命显著的促进了全要素生产率的提升。\n目前很多公司在凭借 AI 技术显著提升了运营效率，导致大规模裁员，但是由新的 AI 科技创造的新的消费场景还没有规模化出现，经济复苏并不明显。\n到底现在是不是算是复苏，谁知道呢？", "reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "commentId": "3215729_87Q65j64o_c3215729_87Tcix5Oo", "userVid": 3215729, "createTime": 1774507428, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}, {"reviewId": "3215729_87Q65j64o", "content": "作者可没说新兴经济体的复兴是回升的信号，只是说在回升阶段可能会出现这样的复兴。说白了既然要回升总有几个先拔头筹的，就看哪个国家功课做得好产业布局早了。或者说小国家“船小好掉头”，比大型经济体更容易转型成功。", "toUserVid": 3215729, "toCommentId": "3215729_87Q65j64o_c3215729_87Tcix5Oo", "commentId": "3215729_87Q65j64o_c374384600_8cxKCAcTI", "userVid": 374384600, "createTime": 1790897340, "author": {"userVid": 374384600, "name": "YYY 加国拔草机", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/sF8HJHCue1YC1OLhN9GptJ4Z8hRwE1xicSJL9SxNYDiaR5LVCfmrj6wXibq53iadGUjiauVlEtr8roWESEYYMUQd4Lg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 3215729, "name": "拿捏小面团", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UcdjjDD5LEFyGn3703HBMuRribudnNC65U0r0PCsL8Hs9E6PiaOoy41U9UHfg5aLJ3h6IxARnCPvKicb3Xa9LlHB49mcjic8zeicvajibl2hDic4fI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1790897340}